+    // PROBE (t1-gxzg, never merges): the census of the resolve's codes (screen_trace_resolve.comp, trace.probeCensus).
+    // With TERTIUS_PROBE_CENSUS_OUT=<folder>, each draw from TERTIUS_PROBE_CENSUS_FROM up to, not including,
+    // TERTIUS_PROBE_CENSUS_TO (counted from 0 over the run) reads back the specular sample, its age, the diffuse sample,
+    // the front distance and the back share, and tallies them. After every counted draw it rewrites <folder>/census.txt,
+    // one line per key: "<key> <samples> <light>", after a first line "draws <n>". The light is the luminance of the
+    // specular sample, pre-exposed. At the last counted draw it also writes the front distance, the back share and the
